                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">If the total size of the QSEv's data to be transmitted fits in a single frame of the underlying bus, the IF PDU is used.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_IdsM_00040</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
