                              <SHORT-NAME>IdsMIfTxPduHandleId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">IdsM does not use this parameter, content will be ignored.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">The existence of this parameter is needed by PduR.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
